@startuml
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
title Session and project storage system

top to bottom direction

actor "User" as User
component "Browser application" as Browser
database "Browser localStorage\nproject snapshots" as Local
component "Session cookie\nsicxe_session" as Cookie
component "ProjectSessionSync" as Sync
component "HTTP session/project API" as API
database "SessionStore\nin-memory" as Store
component "WebSocket /ws\ncommand handler" as WS
component "Simulator\nserver-wide instance" as Simulator

User --> Browser
Browser --> Local
Browser --> Sync
Sync --> Cookie
Sync --> API
API --> Store
Browser --> WS
WS --> Store
WS --> Simulator

note right of Sync
  Validates or creates a session,
  then bulk-syncs the browser's
  full project set over HTTP.
end note

note right of API
  Session and project endpoints:
  create / read session
  list or replace project set
  get / upsert / delete project
  upsert / delete file
end note

note right of Store
  Owns session-scoped project and
  file snapshots. In-memory limits,
  expiry and LRU eviction apply.
end note

note bottom of WS
  After project sync, load uses
  sessionId + projectId to fetch
  the selected project from Store.
end note

note bottom of Simulator
  Machine state is held by the
  server-wide Simulator instance,
  not inside SessionStore.
end note
@enduml
